    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκολ-άπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut</i> or <i>carve upon</i> stone, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γράμματα ἐς τὸν τάφον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.187
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.313.166
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τᾷ στάλᾳ</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				12(1).694.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Camirus</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύποι ἐν πέτρῃσι ἐγκεκολαμμένοι, γράμματα ἐν λίθῳ
				ἐγκ</span>., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				136
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				6.33(35)
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τρίποσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πίνακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς ἕβδομος; εἰς τὸ
					μέτωπον</span>
			
